        {"en": "The food was very tasty.", "kn": "ಊಟ ತುಂಬಾ ರುಚಿಯಾಗಿತ್ತು.", "tr": "Oota tumba ruchiyagittu.", "tip": "A kind compliment goes a long way."}
      ]
